        "new_string": "    /// Configure the max. number of columns used for printing matching lines.\n    pub fn max_columns(mut self, max_columns: Option<usize>) -> Printer<W> {\n        self.max_columns = max_columns;\n        self\n    }\n\n    /// When set, line numbers are left-padded with spaces so that they all\n    /// occupy the given width. Line numbers wider than this width are not\n    /// truncated.\n    pub fn max_line_number_width(\n        mut self,\n        max_line_number_width: Option<usize>,\n    ) -> Printer<W> {\n        self.max_line_number_width = max_line_number_width;\n        self\n    }"
